CHAPTER.VERS:
Open

          {+}
         the gates, that the righteous nation which keeps faith may enter in.

Trust

          {+}
         in Yahweh forever; for in Yah, Yahweh, is an everlasting rock.

Your dead will live; my dead bodies will arise. Awake and sing, you

          {+}
         who stay in the dust; for your dew is [as] the dew of herbs, and the earth will cast forth the spirits of the dead.
